      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2fcd54aa79bc16b2\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe entire island of Anglesey is designated as an Area of Outstanding Natural Beauty. (It is the largest AONB in Wales.) Anybody who has spent time there and visited some of the exceptionally beautiful coastal areas will readily appreciate the reason for this designation.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2fcd54aa79bc16b2\">>>",
